01:00.967 --> 01:03.067
- Ooh, take a look at this,
Gare Bear.
- 哦，看看这个，
盖尔熊.

01:03.100 --> 01:04.867
Found a slime ball
in your shoe?
发现一个粘液球
在你的鞋子里？

01:04.933 --> 01:06.633
Even purebred snails
can fall victim
即使是纯种蜗牛
可能成为受害者

01:06.700 --> 01:10.333
to the scourge of slime balls.
对付粘液球的祸害。

01:10.400 --> 01:13.900
[Gary hacking,
SpongeBob groans]
[加里黑客，
海绵宝宝呻吟]

01:13.967 --> 01:15.867
You really got some air
on that one.
你确实有一些空气
在那一个上。

01:15.933 --> 01:16.667
- Meow.
- 喵。

01:16.733 --> 01:17.900
- I know that meow.
- 我知道那个喵。

01:17.967 --> 01:19.500
That says "I'm hungry."
那句话是“我饿了”。

01:19.567 --> 01:21.567
Lucky for you,
I speak fluent snail.
你很幸运，
我能说流利的蜗牛语。

01:27.300 --> 01:28.267
- Meow!
- 喵！

01:30.300 --> 01:31.867
- Meow-meow!
- 喵喵！

01:33.633 --> 01:35.733
- Oh, of course!
- 哦，当然！

01:35.800 --> 01:38.333
You wanna go for a walk?
你想去散步吗？

01:38.400 --> 01:40.400
Gary, you really need to work
on your pronunciation.
加里，你真的需要工作
关于你的发音。

01:46.300 --> 01:47.700
Okay, no walkies.
好吧，没有步话机。

01:52.633 --> 01:55.233
- Oh, if only you could talk
like a person.
- 哦，如果你能说话就好了
像一个人。

01:57.400 --> 01:58.667
Ooh!
哦！

01:58.733 --> 02:01.067
"The chatterbox
translation collar?
“话匣子
翻译领？

02:01.100 --> 02:03.533
Know what your best friend
is saying!"
知道你最好的朋友是什么
正在说！”

02:03.600 --> 02:04.867
A snail translator!
蜗牛翻译器！

02:04.933 --> 02:06.300
That's a great idea, Gary.
这是个好主意，加里。

02:07.367 --> 02:08.733
- Chatterbox order line.
- 话匣子订单行。

02:08.800 --> 02:09.967
- Hello, yes,
could you please send me
- 你好，是的，
你能发给我吗

02:10.067 --> 02:11.633
one chatterbox snail collar?
一个话匣子蜗牛项圈？

02:11.700 --> 02:13.067
- Do you want regular, express,
- 您想要普通的、特快的、

02:13.133 --> 02:15.800
or our fastest delivery option,
time warp?
或我们最快的交付选项，
时间扭曲？

02:15.867 --> 02:18.067
- Ooh, time warp, please!
- 哦，时间扭曲，拜托！

02:18.133 --> 02:20.633
- Very well, your package
was delivered last Thursday.
- 很好，你的包裹
已于上周四交付。

02:23.233 --> 02:26.467
- Oh, I wonder
where this came from.
- 哦，我想知道
这是从哪里来的。

02:34.533 --> 02:36.167
Oh, here we go.
哦，我们开始吧。

02:36.233 --> 02:38.500
Okay, Gary, speak to me.
好吧，加里，跟我说话。

02:38.567 --> 02:40.967
- Check, check.
- 检查，检查。

02:41.067 --> 02:42.633
- One, two.
- 一，二。

02:42.700 --> 02:44.567
Ah, that's more like it.
啊，这更像是这样。

02:44.633 --> 02:46.767
Hello, there, Papa Bob.
你好，鲍勃爸爸。

02:48.233 --> 02:49.700
- Papa Bob.
- 鲍勃爸爸。

02:49.767 --> 02:51.400
Oh!
Oh, Gary,
哦！
哦，加里，

02:51.467 --> 02:53.300
now you can express
your innermost thoughts
现在你可以表达
你内心深处的想法

02:53.367 --> 02:57.167
in language I can understand.
用我能理解的语言。

02:57.233 --> 02:58.867
I have so many questions.
我有很多问题。

02:58.933 --> 03:00.700
- Lay 'em on me, Papa Bob.
- 把它们放在我身上，鲍勃爸爸。

03:04.133 --> 03:07.367
- Mostly I dream
I'm flying above it all...
- 主要是我在做梦
我飞翔在这一切之上...

03:07.433 --> 03:08.767
- Aww, that's sweet.
- 哇，太甜了。

03:08.833 --> 03:10.300
- While I breathe fiery
destruction
- 当我呼吸着火热的时候
破坏

03:10.367 --> 03:12.367
upon my enemies.
临到我的敌人身上。

03:16.900 --> 03:18.733
Hey, if you're gonna dream,
嘿，如果你要梦想，

03:18.800 --> 03:19.967
dream big, right?
梦想很大，对吗？

03:20.067 --> 03:21.367
Let's move on
让我们继续前进

03:21.433 --> 03:22.467
to question two,
shall we?
提出问题二，
我们可以吗？

03:22.533 --> 03:24.067
What are your long
你的长是多少

03:24.100 --> 03:26.500
- To finish
restoring my hotrod.
- 完成
恢复我的热棒。

03:30.633 --> 03:31.900
- Yeah,
you need to get on that.
- 是的，
你需要继续下去。

03:31.967 --> 03:34.500
But what I really
want to know is,
但我真正
想知道的是，

03:34.567 --> 03:39.400
how do I look
in these pants?
我看起来怎么样
在这条裤子里？

03:39.467 --> 03:40.900
- They really bring out
- 他们真的带出来了

03:40.967 --> 03:43.533
the sharp corners
of your buttocks.
尖角
你的臀部。

03:43.600 --> 03:45.333
- Oh, Gary, you flatterer.
- 哦，加里，你这个马屁精。

03:45.400 --> 03:48.233
Come on, Gare, let's show
Patrick your new voice.
来吧，Gare，让我们展示一下
帕特里克，你的新声音。

03:48.300 --> 03:50.967
Oh, Patrick, I have got
a surprise for you!
哦，帕特里克，我有
给你一个惊喜！

03:51.067 --> 03:53.533
Say hello to Gary.
向加里问好。

03:53.600 --> 03:55.867
- Hello, Gary.
- 你好，加里。

03:55.933 --> 03:57.767
- Hello, stinky man.
- 你好，臭男人。

03:57.833 --> 04:00.500
Hmm.
唔。

04:03.233 --> 04:04.267
Phew!
唷！

04:04.333 --> 04:10.433
Ooh, you're right, Gary,
I am ripe!
哦，你是对的，加里，
我成熟了！

04:10.500 --> 04:12.133
Ah, much better.
啊，好多了。

04:14.667 --> 04:16.600
- Delightfully disgusting.
- 令人愉快的恶心。

04:16.667 --> 04:20.767
- Thank you, my good man.
- 谢谢你，我的好人。

04:20.833 --> 04:23.367
- Thanks for the old
tooth scrubbing!
- 谢谢老
刷牙！

04:23.433 --> 04:24.767
Bye!
- Sandy!
再见！
- 桑迪！

04:24.833 --> 04:26.533
Gary has a new
translating collar.
加里有一个新的
翻译领。

04:26.600 --> 04:29.100
- Hello, hairy astronaut lady.
- 你好，毛茸茸的宇航员女士。

04:31.167 --> 04:33.600
- You know, same shell,
different day.
- 你知道，同样的外壳，
不同的一天。

04:35.667 --> 04:36.900
- Aww, that ain't nothing.
- 哇哦，那没什么。

04:36.967 --> 04:39.800
I invented a nut translator
ages ago.
我发明了坚果翻译器
很久以前。

04:39.867 --> 04:40.800
- The pistachios
are all out to get me.
- 开心果
都想抓我。

04:40.867 --> 04:42.233
You can't trust 'em.
你不能相信他们。

04:42.300 --> 04:43.667
They're working
for the peanut mafia!
他们正在工作
为了花生黑手党！

04:43.733 --> 04:47.133
Walnuts are extra nutty.
核桃有额外的坚果味。

04:47.200 --> 04:48.933
- Om.
- 唵。

04:49.067 --> 04:51.533
- In order to achieve
complete brainfulness,
- 为了实现
完全的头脑，

04:51.600 --> 04:56.733
one must clear one's mind
of all distractions.
必须清醒头脑
排除一切干扰。

04:58.533 --> 05:01.200
Distractions are only
in your mind.
干扰只是
在你的脑海里。

05:02.867 --> 05:05.267
- You are the center
of the universe.
- 你是中心
宇宙的。

05:06.900 --> 05:09.167
- Center of the universe.
- 宇宙中心。

05:09.233 --> 05:12.200
[doorbell continues ringing,
Squidward continues grumbling]
[门铃继续响，
章鱼哥继续抱怨]

05:12.267 --> 05:15.067
- Will you answer the door
already?
- 你会开门吗
已经？

05:17.900 --> 05:19.667
- I think your doorbell's
broken, Squidward.
- 我想你的门铃是
破碎了，章鱼哥。

05:21.300 --> 05:23.167
- I thought you might want to
chat with your neighbor.
- 我以为你可能想要
和你的邻居聊天。

05:23.233 --> 05:26.167
- Why would I want to
talk to you?
- 为什么我想要
跟你说话吗？

05:26.233 --> 05:28.567
- Oh, not to me.
To Gary.
- 哦，对我来说不是。
给加里.

05:28.633 --> 05:30.800
- Oh, good grief.
SpongeBob, Gary can't talk.
- 哦，真可惜。
海绵宝宝、加里不会说话。

05:30.867 --> 05:32.333
He's a snail!
他是一只蜗牛！

05:32.400 --> 05:35.167
- Greetings and salutations,
grouchy man.
- 问候和问候，
脾气暴躁的人。

05:37.633 --> 05:40.067
- I bought Gary the new pet
translator collar.
- 我给加里买了新宠物
翻译领。

05:40.067 --> 05:42.300
- Why would you
want to talk to him?
- 你为什么要
想和他说话吗？

05:42.367 --> 05:43.967
- Who wouldn't want to
talk to their pet?
- 谁不想
和他们的宠物说话？

05:44.067 --> 05:45.833
- I was talking to Gary.
- 我正在和加里说话。

05:45.900 --> 05:48.500
- Oh.
Those walls!
- 哦。
那些墙！

05:48.567 --> 05:49.933
That carpet.
那块地毯。

05:50.067 --> 05:52.533
- Turns out Gary
has a very sophisticated
- 事实证明加里
有一个非常复杂的

05:52.600 --> 05:53.767
sense of design.
设计感。

05:55.133 --> 06:00.667
Well, maybe I'll give him
the guided tour.
好吧，也许我会给他
导游。

06:00.733 --> 06:01.733
- Hey, wait up!
- 嘿，等等！

06:03.300 --> 06:07.167
- And up here, you'll find
my true masterworks,
- 在这里，你会发现
我真正的杰作，

06:07.233 --> 06:11.233
Hidden away from the eyes
of the undeserving public.
隐藏在远离视线的地方
不值得的公众。

06:11.300 --> 06:14.967
- Ah, the naive
cephalopod style.
- 啊，天真
头足类动物风格。

06:15.067 --> 06:16.667
Not very sophisticated.
不是很复杂。

06:18.767 --> 06:20.067
See here.
请参阅此处。

06:22.633 --> 06:25.433
- Ugh!
Tacky.
- 呃！
俗气。

06:25.500 --> 06:26.767
- Hold on now!
- 坚持住！

06:26.833 --> 06:29.633
- Don't worry, Squidward,
I'm taking notes for you.
- 别担心，章鱼哥
我正在为你做笔记。

06:29.700 --> 06:32.733
- Feel the plainfulness
flow through you.
- 感受平淡
流过你。

06:34.900 --> 06:36.667
What's wrong with it?
有什么问题吗？

06:36.733 --> 06:38.067
- Nothing, I'm sure.
- 没什么，我确定。

06:38.133 --> 06:40.333
Apparently, no brain required.
显然，不需要大脑。

06:40.400 --> 06:41.233
Come, Papa Bob.
来吧，鲍勃爸爸。

06:41.300 --> 06:42.600
Let's get out of here
我们离开这里吧

06:42.667 --> 06:44.667
before this bad taste
rubs off on us.
在这糟糕的味道之前
影响我们。

06:47.133 --> 06:49.067
- Don't be sad, Squidward,
we'll be back soon.
- 别伤心，章鱼哥，
我们很快就会回来。

06:50.500 --> 06:51.567
- Until next time,
- 直到下次，

06:51.633 --> 06:52.867
remember to free yourself
记得释放自己

06:52.933 --> 06:55.500
from all distraction.
远离一切干扰。

06:55.567 --> 06:58.267
- Oh, I will.
- 哦，我会的。

07:03.200 --> 07:04.733
Night, Gare Bear.
晚上，盖尔熊。

07:04.800 --> 07:06.633
- Good night, Papa Bob.
- 晚安，鲍勃爸爸。

07:09.700 --> 07:13.867
- Good night.
- 晚安。

07:16.700 --> 07:18.400
- Ah, let's see if SpongeBob
- 啊，让我们看看海绵宝宝是否

07:18.467 --> 07:22.100
still wants you to talk
after tonight.
还是想让你说话
今晚之后。

07:30.733 --> 07:32.800
Stupid rake!
愚蠢的耙子！

07:32.867 --> 07:34.433
Oh, Papa Bob.
哦，鲍勃爸爸。

07:34.500 --> 07:36.233
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

07:36.300 --> 07:38.467
Oh, Papa Bob.
哦，鲍勃爸爸。

07:40.800 --> 07:42.400
- I'm thirsty.
- 我渴了。

07:43.467 --> 07:44.600
At this hour?
这个时候？

07:44.667 --> 07:47.333
All right, I'll get you
some water.
好吧，我来接你
一些水。

07:53.200 --> 07:54.333
- Here you go, buddy,
- 给你，伙计，

07:54.400 --> 07:55.333
one water.
一水。

07:57.067 --> 07:59.367
- I want to go to the park.
- 我想去公园。

08:00.467 --> 08:03.067
Oh, sure.
No problem, Gary.
哦，当然。
没问题，加里。

08:11.767 --> 08:13.500
Well, that was fun.
嗯，那很有趣。

08:18.767 --> 08:20.767
- My bed is too lumpy.
- 我的床太凹凸不平了。

08:20.833 --> 08:22.800
- All right, then.
- 好吧，那么。

08:22.867 --> 08:24.867
Here, Gary, take my bed, hmm?
在这里，加里，占据我的床，嗯？

08:28.400 --> 08:31.067
- Papa Bob, it's hot in here.
- 鲍勃爸爸，这里很热。

08:35.333 --> 08:37.533
- Still too stuffy.
- 还是太闷了。

08:37.600 --> 08:38.700
- Still too--
——还是——

08:43.833 --> 08:45.400
How's that, Gary?
怎么样，加里？

08:45.467 --> 08:48.567
- The view is so much nicer
a block away.
- 景色好多了
一个街区远。

08:48.633 --> 08:50.500
- Okay, okay.
- 好吧，好吧。

08:53.433 --> 08:55.900
This should get things rolling.
这应该能让事情顺利进行。

09:01.167 --> 09:03.233
- Keep going.
- 继续前进。

09:03.300 --> 09:05.733
Just a little more.
再多一点。

09:09.133 --> 09:13.767
Perfect.
完美的。

09:15.633 --> 09:17.367
You're right, Gary.
你是对的，加里。

09:17.433 --> 09:19.300
The view is nicer over here.
这里的景色更好。

09:19.367 --> 09:21.800
Gary?
Gary!
加里？
加里！

09:38.333 --> 09:40.767
[wheels screech,
houses clatter]
[车轮吱吱作响，
房屋嘎嘎作响]

09:48.100 --> 09:49.333
Whoa!
哇！

09:49.400 --> 09:51.467
Oh-whoa-oh! Oh, god!
Oh, god!
哦-哇-哦！哦，天啊！
哦，天啊！

10:04.833 --> 10:05.900
Whew!
哇！

10:05.967 --> 10:07.933
Aww, that was close, huh, Gary?
哇哦，很接近了，是吧，加里？

10:11.067 --> 10:12.000
Oops.
哎呀。

10:16.633 --> 10:20.767
- Aww, now where are
we gonna sleep?
- 哇，现在在哪里
我们要睡觉吗？

10:27.833 --> 10:29.233
You could always live
你可以永远活下去

10:29.300 --> 10:32.600
in a hole,
like that idiot sea star.
在一个洞里，
就像那个白痴海星一样。

11:04.900 --> 11:06.167
- My house!
- 我的房子！

11:06.233 --> 11:08.100
Oh, Squidward,
we're neighbors again.
哦，章鱼哥，
我们又是邻居了。

11:08.167 --> 11:09.967
- Get off of...
- 下车...

11:10.067 --> 11:12.167
- Uh, I didn't catch that,
Squidward, what'd you say?
- 呃，我没听清，
章鱼哥，你说什么？

11:12.233 --> 11:13.700
- I said, "Get off of"...
- 我说，“滚开”...

11:18.700 --> 11:19.567
- Hey!
- 嘿！

11:19.633 --> 11:21.400
- Hey!
- 嘿！

11:21.467 --> 11:23.233
Come back with my worm!
带着我的虫子回来吧！

11:32.600 --> 11:34.533
- Aww, looks like Squidward
- 哇哦，看起来像章鱼哥

11:34.600 --> 11:36.400
wants a pet of his own
to talk to.
想要一只自己的宠物
交谈。

11:36.467 --> 11:38.167
Meow.
喵。

喵。